BT /F2 16 Tf 54 720.0 Td (DAY 4: APIs - How Apps Talk to Each Other) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 668.6 Td (The Big Idea) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647.4 Td (An API \(Application Programming Interface\) is like a menu at a restaurant:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.4 Td (* The menu shows you what you CAN order) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619.4 Td (* You don't need to know HOW the kitchen makes it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 605.4 Td (* You just ask for what you want, and you get it!) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 567.4 Td (Real Example) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 546.2 Td (When a weather app shows you temperature:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 532.2 Td (1. App asks Weather API: "What's the temperature in New York?") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 518.2 Td (2. API replies: "72 degrees, sunny") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 504.2 Td (3. App shows it to you beautifully) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 476.2 Td (The app doesn't have a thermometer - it ASKS another service!) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 438.2 Td (Types of APIs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403.0 Td (REST API \(Most Common\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 389.0 Td (* Uses HTTP methods like a library system:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 375.0 Td (* GET = Read a book \(get data\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361.0 Td (* POST = Add a new book \(create data\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347.0 Td (* PUT = Replace a book \(update data\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 333.0 Td (* DELETE = Remove a book \(delete data\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 301.0 Td (  GET /users/123        --> Give me info about user 123) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 288.4 Td (  POST /users           --> Create a new user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 275.8 Td (  PUT /users/123        --> Update user 123's info) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 263.2 Td (  DELETE /users/123     --> Delete user 123) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 232.6 Td (GraphQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218.6 Td (* Like ordering custom pizza: "I want only cheese and mushrooms") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 204.6 Td (* You ask for EXACTLY what you need, nothing more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190.6 Td (* Facebook created it!) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 162.6 Td (gRPC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 148.6 Td (* Super fast, like a bullet train) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 134.6 Td (* Used when servers talk to each other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 120.6 Td (* Google created it!) Tj ET
endstream
