BT /F2 13 Tf 54 201.8 Td (How Indexing Works) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 176.6 Td (  Without Index \(Full Table Scan\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 164.0 Td (  Page 1 -> Page 2 -> Page 3 -> ... -> Page 1,000,000 -> FOUND IT!) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 151.4 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 138.8 Td (  With Index \(B-Tree\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 126.2 Td (  Start -> Is it > M? Yes -> Is it > S? No -> Check P-S section -> FOUND "Smith"!) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 113.6 Td (  \(Only 3 steps instead of 1 million!\)) Tj ET
endstream
