BT /F1 9 Tf 64 355.0 Td (  Bucket holds 10 tokens. Each request takes 1 token.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 342.4 Td (  Tokens refill at rate of 2 per second.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 329.8 Td (  - Request 1-10: Allowed \(10 tokens used\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 317.2 Td (  - Request 11: DENIED \(bucket empty\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 304.6 Td (  - Wait 1 second: 2 tokens refilled) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 292.0 Td (  - Request 12-13: Allowed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 275.4 Td (Like: A candy machine that drops 2 candies per minute) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 247.4 Td (2. Sliding Window) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 229.4 Td (  Window = last 60 seconds) Tj ET
