BT /F1 9 Tf 64 204.2 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 191.6 Td (  Time 0:00 - 0:59: You made 100 requests \(at limit!\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 179.0 Td (  Time 0:30 - 1:29: Count only requests in THIS window) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 162.4 Td (Like: Counting cars on a highway in the last hour) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 134.4 Td (3. Fixed Window) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 116.4 Td (  Each minute resets the counter) Tj ET
