BT /F2 16 Tf 54 720.0 Td (DAY 22: Data Consistency Patterns) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 668.6 Td (The Big Idea) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647.4 Td (When you have multiple copies of data, how do you keep them in sync?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.4 Td (Like: If you update your profile photo, when do all your friends see the new one?) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 595.4 Td (Consistency Levels) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 560.2 Td (1. Strong Consistency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 546.2 Td (* Everyone sees the same data at the same time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 532.2 Td (* Like: Bank balance \(must be exact!\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 518.2 Td (* Slow but accurate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 504.2 Td (* Example: After transferring money, balance is immediately correct everywhere) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 476.2 Td (2. Eventual Consistency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 462.2 Td (* Data will be the same EVENTUALLY \(might take seconds\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 448.2 Td (* Like: Social media likes \(it's okay if count is slightly off for a moment\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 434.2 Td (* Fast but temporarily inaccurate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420.2 Td (* Example: You post a photo, friends see it a few seconds later) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 392.2 Td (3. Causal Consistency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 378.2 Td (* Related events appear in correct order) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364.2 Td (* Like: In a chat, replies always appear after the original message) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350.2 Td (* Middle ground) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 312.2 Td (Memory Trick) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291.0 Td (* Strong = Synchronized Instantly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277.0 Td (* Eventual = Eventually Everyone sees it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 263.0 Td (* Causal = Cause before effect) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 225.0 Td (Real World Choices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 203.8 Td (System  |  Consistency  |  Why) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 191.2 Td (Banking  |  Strong  |  Money must be exact) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 178.6 Td (Instagram Likes  |  Eventual  |  Who cares if it's 999 vs 1000 for 2 seconds?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 166.0 Td (Google Docs  |  Strong  |  Multiple editors must see same thing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 153.4 Td (DNS  |  Eventual  |  OK if new website takes hours to propagate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 140.8 Td (Stock prices  |  Strong  |  Traders need exact prices) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 104.2 Td (Today's Quiz) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 83.0 Td (1. Why is strong consistency slower?) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
