BT /F2 13 Tf 54 668.6 Td (The Big Idea) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647.4 Td (* Batch Processing = Washing clothes once a week \(collect all, process together\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.4 Td (* Stream Processing = Assembly line at a factory \(process each item as it arrives\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 595.4 Td (Batch Processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 570.2 Td (  Collect data --> Wait until there's a lot --> Process all at once) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 553.6 Td (* Example: Netflix generating "recommended for you" overnight) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 539.6 Td (* Example: Monthly bank statements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 525.6 Td (* Example: Daily sales reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 497.6 Td (Tools: Hadoop, Apache Spark, AWS Batch) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 459.6 Td (Stream Processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 434.4 Td (  Data arrives --> Process immediately --> Results in real-time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 417.8 Td (* Example: Fraud detection \(block suspicious transaction instantly\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403.8 Td (* Example: Live traffic updates on Google Maps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 389.8 Td (* Example: Real-time sports scores) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361.8 Td (Tools: Apache Kafka Streams, Apache Flink, Apache Storm) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 323.8 Td (Comparison) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 302.6 Td (Feature  |  Batch  |  Stream) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 290.0 Td (When processed  |  Later \(scheduled\)  |  Immediately) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 277.4 Td (Latency  |  Minutes to hours  |  Milliseconds to seconds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 264.8 Td (Data size  |  Very large  |  One event at a time) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 252.2 Td (Complexity  |  Simpler  |  More complex) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 239.6 Td (Use case  |  Reports, ML training  |  Alerts, real-time dashboards) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 203.0 Td (Lambda Architecture \(Best of Both!\)) Tj ET
