BT /F1 9 Tf 64 165.2 Td (     |                                                          |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 152.6 Td (     +--> [Speed Layer: Process REAL-TIME data]  --> [Real-time View]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 140.0 Td (                                                            |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 127.4 Td (                              [Query: Merge batch + real-time views]) Tj ET
endstream
