BT /F2 16 Tf 54 720.0 Td (DAY 38: Circuit Breaker Pattern) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 668.6 Td (The Big Idea) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647.4 Td (A circuit breaker in software works like a circuit breaker in your home. When there's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.4 Td (an electrical problem, it trips and cuts power to prevent fire. In software, it stops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619.4 Td (calling a failing service to prevent cascading failures!) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 581.4 Td (The Problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 556.2 Td (  Service A calls Service B.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 543.6 Td (  Service B is down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 531.0 Td (  Without circuit breaker:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 518.4 Td (    Service A keeps trying... waiting... timing out... ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 505.8 Td (    Service A gets slow...) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 493.2 Td (    Service C \(which depends on A\) gets slow too...) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 480.6 Td (    EVERYTHING cascades and crashes!) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 440.0 Td (Circuit Breaker States) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 414.8 Td (  [CLOSED] -- too many failures --> [OPEN] -- timeout expires --> [HALF-OPEN]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 402.2 Td (     |                                |                              |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 389.6 Td (     | Normal operation               | Reject all requests          | Allow few test requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 377.0 Td (     | Requests pass through          | Return error immediately     |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 364.4 Td (     |                                |                              |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 351.8 Td (     | <-- success -- [HALF-OPEN] -- if tests pass --> back to CLOSED) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 339.2 Td (                                     -- if tests fail --> back to OPEN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 308.6 Td (CLOSED \(Normal\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 294.6 Td (* Everything working fine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 280.6 Td (* Requests pass through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 266.6 Td (* Count failures) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 238.6 Td (OPEN \(Protection mode\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 224.6 Td (* Too many failures detected!) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 210.6 Td (* Reject requests immediately \(don't even try\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 196.6 Td (* Wait for timeout period) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 168.6 Td (HALF-OPEN \(Testing\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 154.6 Td (* After timeout, try a few requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 140.6 Td (* If they succeed -> CLOSE \(back to normal!\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 126.6 Td (* If they fail -> OPEN again \(still broken\)) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
