BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647.4 Td (A Bloom Filter is a space-efficient data structure that tells you:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.4 Td (* "Definitely NOT in the set" \(100% sure\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619.4 Td (* "PROBABLY in the set" \(might be wrong\)) Tj ET
