BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218.2 Td (1. GeoDNS: DNS resolves to nearest region based on user's IP) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 204.2 Td (2. Anycast: Same IP, network routes to nearest server) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190.2 Td (3. Global Load Balancer: Smart routing based on health + latency) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 152.2 Td (The Hard Part: Data Consistency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 131.0 Td (* Data written in US must be readable in Asia) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 117.0 Td (* Replication lag: 100-300ms between regions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 103.0 Td (* Options:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 89.0 Td (* Strong consistency: All writes go to one region \(slow for far users\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 75.0 Td (* Eventual consistency: Write locally, sync later \(fast but stale\)) Tj ET
