BT /F1 10 Tf 54 205.4 Td (* Every component gets MINIMUM permissions needed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 191.4 Td (* Database user for app: Only SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE \(not DROP!\)) Tj ET
