BT /F2 13 Tf 54 720.0 Td (Step 3: Database Strategy) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 694.8 Td (  Chat: Cassandra \(high write throughput, time-series\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 682.2 Td (  Payment: PostgreSQL \(ACID, strong consistency\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 669.6 Td (  Food Orders: MongoDB \(flexible schema, varies by restaurant\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 657.0 Td (  Ride: Redis \(real-time locations\) + PostgreSQL \(trip history\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 644.4 Td (  Social: Cassandra \(feed\) + Elasticsearch \(search\) + Neo4j \(connections\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 631.8 Td (  User: PostgreSQL \(master data\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 591.2 Td (Step 4: Cross-Cutting Concerns) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 566.0 Td (  Authentication: JWT + OAuth2 \(single sign-on across all services\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 553.4 Td (  Rate Limiting: Per-user, per-service, per-endpoint) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 540.8 Td (  Logging: Centralized \(ELK Stack\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 528.2 Td (  Tracing: Distributed tracing \(Jaeger\) - track request across services) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 515.6 Td (  Feature Flags: Gradual rollout of new features) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 503.0 Td (  A/B Testing: Test different experiences) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 462.4 Td (Step 5: Scalability Plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 437.2 Td (  Scaling Strategy per Service:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 424.6 Td (  - Chat: Horizontal \(add WebSocket servers\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 412.0 Td (  - Payment: Vertical + Read replicas \(reliability > scale\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 399.4 Td (  - Food: Horizontal \(geographic sharding by city\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 386.8 Td (  - Ride: Horizontal \(geographic sharding + Redis cluster\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 374.2 Td (  - Social: Horizontal \(sharded by user_id\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 333.6 Td (Step 6: Failure Handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 308.4 Td (  - Circuit breakers between all services) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 295.8 Td (  - Bulkheads \(isolated thread pools\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 283.2 Td (  - Graceful degradation \(if social feed is down, other features work\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 270.6 Td (  - Multi-region active-active for chat and payments) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 258.0 Td (  - Saga pattern for cross-service transactions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 64 245.4 Td (  - Chaos engineering for testing resilience) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 156.8 Td (DAY 100: Final Review & Cheat Sheet) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 105.4 Td (Congratulations! You've completed 100 days of System Design!) Tj ET
